  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_6881.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La Pascua Sonora de Onda ha finalizado este fin de semana, el viernes por la noche con la actuaci&oacute;n de la Orkesta Pelillo y verbena a cargo de La Linea Rock Band, y el s&aacute;bado con el DJ Jesu a mediod&iacute;a, la oquesta Legends por la tarde y verbena despu&eacute;s con Empopados Radio Hit Band.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdesetmanafinalpasquasonora14/img_6443.jpg\" alt=\"img_6443\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdesetmanafinalpasquasonora14/img_6444.jpg\" alt=\"img_6444\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdesetmanafinalpasquasonora14/img_6446.jpg\" alt=\"img_6446\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdesetmanafinalpasquasonora14/img_6447.jpg\" alt=\"img_6447\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdesetmanafinalpasquasonora14/img_6448.jpg\" alt=\"img_6448\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdesetmanafinalpasquasonora14/img_6449.jpg\" alt=\"img_6449\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdesetmanafinalpasquasonora14/img_6450.jpg\" alt=\"img_6450\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdesetmanafinalpasquasonora14/img_6451.jpg\" alt=\"img_6451\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdesetmanafinalpasquasonora14/img_